				41
			],
			"Message": "style(Cocoon): Normalise config JS to 2-space indentation without trailing commas\n\nReformat all Configuration/ESBuild/*.js, Configuration/Mountain/Config.js, and Source/ESBuild.js from tab indentation back to consistent 2-space indentation, the opposite direction from the previous style pass. Alongside the indentation change:\n\n- Remove trailing commas from all array and object literals across every config file.\n- Normalise import ordering so re-exports (`export *`) appear before local imports, and `node:path` imports precede project imports.\n- Consolidate duplicate imports in Target.js (default3/default5 now share a single import from Config/Target/Config.js).\n- Collapse `__name` helper calls in Compile Config.js and Mountain Config.js from multi-line to single-line format.\n- Flatten Environment Constant.js boolean expressions to single lines, and expand exports to multiline block format.\n- Move named export declarations to the end of the module body in Base Config.js, matching the convention used by sibling config files.\n\nRegenerate the RouteManifest timestamp (2026-05-22T06:13:11Z) and rebuild all Target/ compiled artifacts to reflect the reformatted configuration sources. No functional changes to build logic, RPC method registration (still 135 Mountain methods), or runtime behaviour.",
